  "solution": "Given:\n\n8 - 4 ÷ 8 \\:of\\: 3 + (7 ÷ 7 \\:of\\: (1)/(7) ) ÷ 6 + (3 × 6 ÷ (1)/(3)) × (1)/(6)\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/36648f6d9fd5d1d56959b630c72b514ab488f27d2525de3370bb428cc41cf8e9.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n8 - 4 ÷ 8 \\:of\\: 3 + (7 ÷ 7 \\:of\\: (1)/(7) ) ÷ 6 + (3 × 6 ÷ (1)/(3)) × (1)/(6)\n\n⇒ 8 - 4 ÷ 8 \\:of\\: 3 + (7 ÷ 1 ) ÷ 6 + (3 × 6 × 3) × (1)/(6)\n\n⇒ 8 - 4 ÷ 8 \\:of\\: 3 + 7 ÷ 6 + 54 × (1)/(6)\n\n⇒ 8 - 4 ÷ 24 + 7 ÷ 6 + 54 × (1)/(6)\n\n⇒ 8 - (1)/(6) + (7)/(6) + 54 × (1)/(6)\n\n⇒ 8 - (1)/(6) + (7)/(6) + 9\n\n⇒ (48 - 1 + 7 + 54)/(6)\n\n⇒ (109 - 1)/(6)\n\n⇒ (108)/(6) = 18\n\n∴ Required answer is 18.\n\n1d3:T981,\n<p style=&",
